graph LR
    subgraph SG2[Phase 2]
        direction TB
        I{Battery Exchange Power > ε?}
        I -->|~Zero| L[Skip Battery Operations]
        I -->|Positive| J[Charge All Virtual Batteries]
        I -->|Negative| K[Calculate Houses VB Usage]
        J -----> L
        K --> M[Normalize VB Usage Weights]
        M --> N[Discharge Virtual Batteries with Weights]
        N --> L
    end
    subgraph SG3[Phase 3]
        direction TB
        O{Usage Met for All Houses?}
        O -->|No| P[Disconnect Houses with Unmet Usage]
        O -->|Yes| Q[All Houses Remain Connected]
        P --> Q
        Q --> R{Utility Export Power > ε?}
        R -->|Yes| S[Calculate Export Distribution]
        R -->|No| T[Update Inverter Load and Utility States]
        S --> T
        T --> U[Log Virtual Battery States to CSV]
        U --> V[Sleep Until Next Update]
    end
    subgraph SG1[Phase 1]
        direction TB
        A[Read System State] --> B[Normalize Baseline Loads]
        B --> C[Identify Min Weight Houses]
        C --> D{Any Min Weight Houses with Negative Baseline?}
        D -->|Yes| E[Redistribute Negative Baseline to Positive Houses]
        D -->|No| F[Apply Weight Adjustments]
        E --> F
        F --> G[Calculate Excess Capacity from Weight Changes]
        G --> H[Determine Power Distribution Strategy]
    end

    SG1 ==> SG2 ==> SG3 ==> SG1
